Soundtrap            New Windows App release

***********
You asked.
We shipped.
***********

Hearing your own voice through the headphones while you record.
The one feature you've been asking us for. It's here.

Soundtrap Desktop app on Windows      The Windows Desktop
app is live.

Same projects, same collaborators, same account. Just a lot more
power on the machine you already create on.

What's new

=F0=9F=8E=A4   Real-time monitoring

Hear your voice in the cans while you sing it. Track yourself
the way you'd track yourself in a studio. Levels and tone, live,
while you're still in the booth.

=E2=9A=A1   Lower latency

Less lag between you and the take. Native desktop performance
means tighter timing, snappier tracking, fewer takes ruined by
milliseconds.

=F0=9F=8E=A2   No track limit

Stack as deep as the song needs. That vocal stack you've been
trimming to fit? Keep it. Add five more.

Your account is already set up. Your projects
sync automatically. You just need the app.

